    {
      "name": "Tenant Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Tenant",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{bearer_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "",
                  "disabled": false
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/tenant/create",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tenant", "create"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new tenant and user via YAML file upload\n\n**Requirements:**\n- Bearer token authentication\n- YAML file with tenant configuration\n\n**YAML file format:**\n```yaml\ntenant:\n  name: \"Tenant Name\"\n  description: \"Optional description\"\n```\n\n**Returns:**\n- tenant_pkid: Unique tenant identifier\n- username: Created username (tenant_pkid)\n- password: Strong password for the user\n- tenant_name: Name of the created tenant"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success Response",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "Bearer {{bearer_token}}",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    {
                      "key": "file",
                      "type": "file",
                      "src": ""
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/tenant/create",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "tenant", "create"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"tenant_pkid\": \"acme-corp\",\n  \"tenant_name\": \"Acme Corp\",\n  \"username\": \"acme-corp\",\n  \"password\": \"GeneratedStr0ng!Pass\",\n  \"message\": \"Tenant 'Acme Corp' and user 'acme-corp' created successfully\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
